The design is a 5-stage current-starved ring oscillator with a degenerated V→I converter, a minimum-current floor and a two-inverter output buffer. I have not simulated it; the initial sizes are hand estimates for the optimiser to tune across all 45 PVT points.

**How it works**
- **V→I conversion.** `vctrl` drives NMOS `Mc` with source resistor `Rs`, so Iref ≈ (Vctrl − Vgs)/Rs. Degeneration makes the current more linear and less dependent on corner and temperature than a bare square-law device.
- **Current floor.** `Rmin` draws a small extra current from the PMOS diode node `pb`. This keeps the ring oscillating at Vctrl = 0.7 V in the ss / 125 °C / 1.62 V corner, where `Mc` is near threshold.
- **Bias mirroring.** The PMOS diode `Mpd` sets `pb`. `Mpm` mirrors that current into the NMOS diode `Mnd`, which sets `nb`. Both bias nodes feed the starving devices in every stage, scaled by Wps/Wpb and Wns/Wnb.
- **Ring.** Five starved stages use short-L inverters (`Li`) for speed and long-L starving devices (`Lb`) for good mirroring. Five stages give more swing and start-up margin than three. The target is f ≈ I/(5·C·V) ≥ 470 MHz at mid control voltage.
- **Output buffer.** A small inverter followed by a sized inverter restores rail-to-rail swing into CL, even when the starved-stage swing is reduced at the low-Vctrl, ss corner.
- **Power.** The budget is about 380 µA at 1.98 V. Iref is initially set to about 60–80 µA at mid control voltage, which leaves room for the ring and buffer at ff / −40 °C.

```spice
.subckt dut vctrl vout vdd vss
* ---- V->I converter with degeneration and min-current floor ----
Mc   pb vctrl sc vss nfet W={Wc} L={Lc}
Rs   sc vss {Rs}
Rmin pb vss {Rmin}
* ---- bias generation ----
Mpd  pb pb vdd vdd pfet W={Wpb} L={Lb}
Mpm  nb pb vdd vdd pfet W={Wpb} L={Lb}
Mnd  nb nb vss vss nfet W={Wnb} L={Lb}
* ---- stage 1 ----
Mps1 sp1 pb vdd vdd pfet W={Wps} L={Lb}
Mpi1 o1  o5 sp1 vdd pfet W={Wpi} L={Li}
Mni1 o1  o5 sn1 vss nfet W={Wni} L={Li}
Mns1 sn1 nb vss vss nfet W={Wns} L={Lb}
* ---- stage 2 ----
Mps2 sp2 pb vdd vdd pfet W={Wps} L={Lb}
Mpi2 o2  o1 sp2 vdd pfet W={Wpi} L={Li}
Mni2 o2  o1 sn2 vss nfet W={Wni} L={Li}
Mns2 sn2 nb vss vss nfet W={Wns} L={Lb}
* ---- stage 3 ----
Mps3 sp3 pb vdd vdd pfet W={Wps} L={Lb}
Mpi3 o3  o2 sp3 vdd pfet W={Wpi} L={Li}
Mni3 o3  o2 sn3 vss nfet W={Wni} L={Li}
Mns3 sn3 nb vss vss nfet W={Wns} L={Lb}
* ---- stage 4 ----
Mps4 sp4 pb vdd vdd pfet W={Wps} L={Lb}
Mpi4 o4  o3 sp4 vdd pfet W={Wpi} L={Li}
Mni4 o4  o3 sn4 vss nfet W={Wni} L={Li}
Mns4 sn4 nb vss vss nfet W={Wns} L={Lb}
* ---- stage 5 ----
Mps5 sp5 pb vdd vdd pfet W={Wps} L={Lb}
Mpi5 o5  o4 sp5 vdd pfet W={Wpi} L={Li}
Mni5 o5  o4 sn5 vss nfet W={Wni} L={Li}
Mns5 sn5 nb vss vss nfet W={Wns} L={Lb}
* ---- output buffer (2 inverters) ----
Mb1p xb o5 vdd vdd pfet W={Wpi} L=0.15
Mb1n xb o5 vss vss nfet W={Wni} L=0.15
Mb2p vout xb vdd vdd pfet W={Wbp} L=0.15
Mb2n vout xb vss vss nfet W={Wbn} L=0.15
.ends dut
```

